[I] A C library designed for embedded 32- and 64- bit systems

[T] Picolibc is a library offering standard C library APIs that targets small
[T] embedded systems with limited RAM. Picolibc was formed by blending code
[T] from Newlib and AVR Libc.

[U] https://keithp.com/picolibc

